  "signs-replace-old-gas-stove": {
    title: "Signs It's Time to Replace Your Old Gas Stove",
    cat: "Hobs", date: "April 10, 2025", read: "5 min read",
    img: "assets/cat-hob.webp",
    tags: ["Hobs","Maintenance","Safety"],
    body: `
      <p class="lead">A gas stove works hard every day, and even a good one eventually shows its age. Knowing the warning signs helps you upgrade before a tired stove costs you in gas bills, cooking quality — or safety.</p>
      <h2><span class="no">01</span>Uneven or Weak Flames</h2>
      <p>If burners produce weak, uneven or yellow-tipped flames instead of a steady blue, the stove isn't burning gas efficiently. That means slower cooking and wasted gas.</p>
      <h2><span class="no">02</span>The Smell of Gas</h2>
      <p>A persistent gas smell — even faint — is a serious safety concern that points to a leak or failing seals. If it can't be fixed simply, it's a clear sign to replace the unit.</p>
      <div class="pull">When a stove starts affecting your safety or your gas bill, replacing it is the smart, not the extravagant, choice.</div>
      <h2><span class="no">03</span>Ignition Problems</h2>
      <p>Burners that take several tries to light, click endlessly, or won't stay lit indicate worn ignition components — an everyday frustration that rarely gets better on its own.</p>
      <h2><span class="no">04</span>Rust, Cracks and Wear</h2>
      <p>Visible rust, cracked grates or a corroded burner base don't just look bad — they affect performance and can be unsafe. Surface wear often signals deeper deterioration.</p>
      <h2><span class="no">05</span>Rising Gas Bills</h2>
      <p>An inefficient old stove quietly burns more gas for the same cooking. If your bills are creeping up without a change in habits, the stove may be the culprit.</p>
      <h2><span class="no">06</span>Time for an Upgrade</h2>
      <p>If several of these signs sound familiar, a modern hob will cook better, run more efficiently and bring a cleaner, safer, more stylish look to your kitchen.</p>
      <div class="callout"><h4>Upgrade with Fotile</h4><p>Fotile's modern gas and electric hobs deliver strong, even heat, precise control and easy-clean surfaces — a safe, efficient step up from a worn-out stove.</p></div>
    `
  },

